# Governance and CI need an owner review (spec §8, R-gov and R-ci). Code outside these paths
# merges through auto-merge after the gates (spec D13). One file for the monorepo: bosun's rules
# from bosun/.github/CODEOWNERS, with every path prefixed by its folder.

# Repo root: CI, governance config, toolchain and workspace manifests.
/.github/                @urbanisierung
/.bosun/                 @urbanisierung
/.claude/                @urbanisierung
/.splice/                @urbanisierung
/.cargo/                 @urbanisierung
/deny.toml               @urbanisierung
/rust-toolchain.toml     @urbanisierung
/Cargo.toml              @urbanisierung
/Cargo.lock              @urbanisierung
/scripts/                @urbanisierung
/governance/             @urbanisierung
/REVIEW.md               @urbanisierung
/docs/lessons.toml       @urbanisierung
/hoard/action.yml        @urbanisierung
/hoard/action/           @urbanisierung

# Org decisions are governance (the decisions folder was its own repo).
/decisions/decisions/    @urbanisierung
/decisions/DECISIONS.md  @urbanisierung

# Per folder: the same governance paths bosun's own CODEOWNERS named.
